    <sys:String x:Key="LOCDisplayManager_HdrForceSdrTitle">Turn HDR off now</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCDisplayManager_HdrForceSdrHelp">If the picture still looks like HDR after a game (glowing, washed-out desktop), use this button to force a normal SDR picture. Tip: Win+Alt+B also toggles HDR so you can check by eye.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCDisplayManager_HdrWriteOffNow">Turn HDR off on my displays</sys:String>
